---
description: Automatically convert DjVu documents encountered during organization or intake into verified PDF reading copies
alwaysApply: true
---

For `.djvu` or `.djv` documents encountered in the current organization/intake scope,
use `.agents/skills/convert-djvu/SKILL.md` and `tools/djvu_to_pdf.py`.
Automatically prepare selected accessible files in private staging, preserve originals
and existing OCR, and verify the PDF before preferring it for reading.
`AGENTS.md` remains canonical; existing filing approvals and privacy rules still apply.
No background watcher, bulk hydration, source deletion, or global app change is implied.
